{"title":"Glow in the Dark Flowers!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/918266630/0/marginalrevolution~Glow-in-the-Dark-Flowers.html","date":1747221778000,"content":"<p>I love these <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Firefly-Petunia-Bioluminescent-Houseplant-Fragrant/dp/B0F4Y38NNL?tag=marginalrevol-20\">glow-in-the-dark petunias</a>. Aside from the novelty, they speak to science and progress! The petunias were genetically modified to incorporate genes from a bioluminescent mushroom.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Firefly.png\" width=\"851\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Firefly.png 1366w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Firefly-300x132.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Firefly-1024x451.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Firefly-768x338.png 768w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/bioluminescent-petunias.html\">Glow in the Dark Flowers!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/918266630/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/918266630/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/918266630/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f05%2fFirefly.png\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/918266630/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x